    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "I am in Seattle and it is smoky here as it is in much of the west and the northwest and so I think we're all worried about our constituents and people across our states adding yet another crisis on to already multiple crises of the pandemic, unemployment, and then white supremacy. So it's tough. I think a lot of my constituents are really hurting. worried about what the future is and I'm trying to work as hard as I can to change that picture and fix a lot of things that frankly we're going to need a lot of change in leadership to",
