    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88428.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "I think it's fair to say that you are leading the most influential block of progressive power in the federal government since you are the co-chair of the Progressive Caucus. I am just wondering if you can tell us more about your vision for the caucus and what you're learning about leadership in that role.",
