        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the co-chair role as a central position of strategic influence within the caucus.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The addressee has both the capacity and willingness to articulate a clear vision for the caucus.",
