    "turn_text": "Was it a difficult decision at all to speak publicly about this? I mean, I know that different people, different politicians have different ideas about how they want to speak about their family, and particularly when a family member has an identity that is stigmatized by large swaths of the country. I'm wondering about how you make those choices, about what stays personal and",
