    "turn_text": "I love that. It seems like the pandemic has completely erased immigration reform as a crucial issue, even though so many people right now are sitting in detention and so many families are really deeply impacted by this. How do you see the prospects of fixing the broken immigration system given the cards that we have been dealt right now?",
